{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 20, :comments ["<b>לא תחד.</b> The alef of the root is missing, like אוהבי אהב (Proverbs 8:17). And Rabbi Judah the grammarian says that it is missing a yod, from the root יחד." "<b>כי ארצך שחת.</b> If your land you destroyed — all the more so other lands. And its meaning is: and its cities he demolished."], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 14, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:53:47.529065114Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}